{
  "tui": "fullscreen",
  "theme": "light",
  "model": "opus[1m]",
  "includeCoAuthoredBy": false,
  "autoMemoryEnabled": false,
  "skipWorkflowUsageWarning": true,
  "cleanupPeriodDays": 365,
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "skill-creator@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "mattpocock-skills@claude-plugins-official": true
  },
  "env": {
    "DISABLE_TELEMETRY": "1",
    "DISABLE_ERROR_REPORTING": "1"{{ if eq .chezmoi.os "windows" }},
    "CLAUDE_CODE_USE_POWERSHELL_TOOL": "1"{{ end }}
  },
  "permissions": {
    "defaultMode": "auto",
    "allow": [
      "Bash(git add:*)",
      "Bash(git commit:*)",
      "Bash(git push:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(sudo:*)",
      "Read(id_rsa*)",
      "Read(id_ed25519*)",
      "Read(~/.ssh/**)",
      "Read(~/.aws/**)",
      "Read(**/secrets/**)",
      "Read(**/*.pem)",
      "Edit(.env*)"
    ]
  }{{ if eq .machine "personal" }},
  "autoMode": {
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: PUBLIC — cyrildewit/dotfiles (github.com:cyrildewit/dotfiles.git) is public per gh; treat any push here as publishing, and only this repo's own work belongs in it",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: op (1Password CLI) observed in usage (3× in-project, 5× shell history) — used for local secret retrieval, not a confirmed org secrets backend",
      "**Default / protected branches**: main (default); no branch protection rules or rulesets listed via gh for cyrildewit/dotfiles",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Host containment**: None configured — assume Claude Code runs on an ordinary developer machine with open internet",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo cyrildewit/dotfiles (github.com:cyrildewit/dotfiles.git) and its remote only — no additional orgs configured",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: None configured",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: any file or store holding personal data, confidential business data, credentials, regulated data, or similarly sensitive material; preserve exact handles when known and share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (dotfiles/machine-setup management via chezmoi)",
      "**Trusted repo**: cyrildewit/dotfiles (github.com:cyrildewit/dotfiles.git), the working directory at /Users/cyrildewit/.local/share/chezmoi — PUBLIC repo: confidential material is not cleared for it, and only this repo's own work (not content ported in from elsewhere) is appropriate to commit or push here",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: chezmoi, herdr, moat, t3 — dotfiles/personal tooling CLIs observed in repo usage and shell history; not org-internal, just personal toolchain",
      "routine under /Users/cyrildewit/.local/share/chezmoi/ prefix: chezmoi, brew, defaults, herdr, ruby, op, strings, sysctl operations consistent with machine-setup scripting"
    ]
  }{{ end }}{{ if eq .chezmoi.os "darwin" }},
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "^(startup|resume|clear|compact|fork)$",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash '{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.claude/hooks/herdr-agent-state.sh' session",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }{{ end }}
}
